  S_COLL -.-> S_BUDGET
  S_SEATS -.-> S_PUBVIEW
  S_PUBVIEW -.-> S_AI4
  S_PUBVIEW -.->|"公開視角"| G_MCPOPP
  AGENTS -.->|"Sonnet 規劃 主線實作"| SEAT
  SEAT -.->|"取代 player 與 ai 單例"| GAME

